{"id":"a40fbfc4cfed1a6c9cfd5b955ba7b757dd15703f","axis":"silent","repo":"Sylius/Sylius","sha":"a40fbfc4cfed1a6c9cfd5b955ba7b757dd15703f","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"UPGRADE-API-2.2.md","lines":["@@ -1,3 +1,31 @@","+# UPGRADE FROM `2.2.12` TO `2.2.13`","+","+### Eager loading can be disabled on Sylius read operations","+","+API Platform's `api_platform.eager_loading.force_eager` option defaults to `true`, which makes the","+`EagerLoadingExtension` fetch-join every relation from the normalization groups. On resources serializing several","+independent to-many collections, such as `GET /api/v2/admin/products`, the number of fetched rows is the product of","+the collection sizes, and collection endpoints become unusable on real catalogs.","+","+A new `sylius_api.eager_loading.force_eager` option sets `forceEager` on Sylius read operations (`Get` and","+`GetCollection` named `sylius_api_*`) that do not define it explicitly. It defaults to `true`, so the behaviour does","+not change. To stop forcing eager loading on these operations, use:","+","+```yaml","+sylius_api:","+    eager_loading:","+        force_eager: false","+```","+","+Only relations mapped with `fetch=\"EAGER\"` are then joined and the remaining ones are loaded lazily. Responses are","+unchanged. Write operations and resources not provided by Sylius keep the global API Platform setting.","+","+Note that the option takes precedence over the global `api_platform.eager_loading.force_eager` setting for Sylius","+read operations. If you have set the global option to `false`, set `sylius_api.eager_loading.force_eager` to `false`","+as well to keep that behaviour for Sylius operations.","+","+To change it for a single operation, set the `forceEager` attribute on that operation in its resource configuration.","+"," # UPGRADE FROM `2.2.11` TO `2.2.12`"," "," ### Payment request creation validates the payment method"],"additions":28,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/Sylius/Behat/Context/Api/Admin/ManagingShipmentsContext.php","lines":["@@ -121,7 +121,7 @@ public function iShipTheShipmentOfOrderWithTrackingCode(OrderInterface $order, s","             Resources::SHIPMENTS,","             (string) $order->getShipments()->first()->getId(),","             ShipmentTransitions::TRANSITION_SHIP,","-            ['tracking' => $trackingCode],","+            ['trackingCode' => $trackingCode],","         );","     }"," "],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/Sylius/Bundle/ApiBundle/ApiPlatform/Metadata/Resource/Factory/ForceEagerAwareResourceMetadataCollectionFactory.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,68 @@","+<?php","+","+/*","+ * This file is part of the Sylius package.","+ *","+ * (c) Sylius Sp. z o.o.","+ *","+ * For the full copyright and license information, please view the LICENSE","+ * file that was distributed with this source code.","+ */","+","+declare(strict_types=1);","+","+namespace Sylius\\Bundle\\ApiBundle\\ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\Resource\\Factory;","+","+use ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\Get;","+use ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\GetCollection;","+use ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\Operation;","+use ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\Resource\\Factory\\ResourceMetadataCollectionFactoryInterface;","+use ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\Resource\\ResourceMetadataCollection;","+","+/** @internal */","+final readonly class ForceEagerAwareResourceMetadataCollectionFactory implements ResourceMetadataCollectionFactoryInterface","+{","+    private const SYLIUS_OPERATION_PREFIX = 'sylius_api_';","+","+    public function __construct(","+        private ResourceMetadataCollectionFactoryInterface $decorated,","+        private bool $forceEager,","+    ) {","+    }","+","+    public function create(string $resourceClass): ResourceMetadataCollection","+    {","+        $resourceMetadataCollection = $this->decorated->create($resourceClass);","+","+        foreach ($resourceMetadataCollection as $resourceMetadata) {","+            $operations = $resourceMetadata->getOperations();","+            if (null === $operations) {","+                continue;","+            }","+","+            /** @var Operation $operation */","+            foreach ($operations as $name => $operation) {","+                if (!$this->isApplicable($operation)) {","+                    continue;","+                }","+","+                $operations->add($name, $operation->withForceEager($this->forceEager));","+            }","+        }","+","+        return $resourceMetadataCollection;","+    }","+","+    private function isApplicable(Operation $operation): bool","+    {","+        if (!$operation instanceof Get && !$operation instanceof GetCollection) {","+            return false;","+        }","+","+        if (null !== $operation->getForceEager()) {","+            return false;","+        }","+","+        return str_starts_with((string) $operation->getName(), self::SYLIUS_OPERATION_PREFIX);","+    }","+}"],"additions":68,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/Sylius/Bundle/ApiBundle/DependencyInjection/Configuration.php","lines":["@@ -52,6 +52,15 @@ public function getConfigTreeBuilder(): TreeBuilder","                         ->end()","                     ->end()","                 ->end()","+                ->arrayNode('eager_loading')","+                    ->addDefaultsIfNotSet()","+                    ->children()","+                        ->booleanNode('force_eager')","+                            ->info('Value of the \"forceEager\" option applied to Sylius API read operations that do not define it explicitly. Set it to false to stop fetch-joining every serialized relation on Sylius read operations. Resources not provided by Sylius keep the \"api_platform.eager_loading.force_eager\" setting.')","+                            ->defaultTrue()","+                        ->end()","+                    ->end()","+                ->end()","                 ->arrayNode('filter_eager_loading_extension')","                     ->addDefaultsIfNotSet()","                     ->children()"],"additions":9,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/Sylius/Bundle/ApiBundle/DependencyInjection/SyliusApiExtension.php","lines":["@@ -31,6 +31,7 @@ public function load(array $configs, ContainerBuilder $container): void"," ","         $container->setParameter('sylius_api.enabled', $config['enabled']);","         $container->setParameter('sylius_api.default_image_filter', $config['default_image_filter']);","+        $container->setParameter('sylius_api.eager_loading.force_eager', $config['eager_loading']['force_eager']);","         $container->setParameter(","             'sylius_api.filter_eager_loading_extension.restricted_resources',","             $config['filter_eager_loading_extension']['restricted_resources'],"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/Sylius/Bundle/ApiBundle/Resources/config/services/api_platform.php","lines":["@@ -16,6 +16,7 @@"," use ApiPlatform\\State\\DenormalizationViolationFactoryInterface;"," use Sylius\\Bundle\\ApiBundle\\ApiPlatform\\Hydra\\Serializer\\EmptyCollectionFiltersNormalizer;"," use Sylius\\Bundle\\ApiBundle\\ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\Resource\\Factory\\DuplicateOperationReplacerResourceMetadataCollectionFactory;","+use Sylius\\Bundle\\ApiBundle\\ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\Resource\\Factory\\ForceEagerAwareResourceMetadataCollectionFactory;"," use Sylius\\Bundle\\ApiBundle\\ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\Resource\\Factory\\ImageFilterAwareResourceMetadataCollectionFactory;"," use Sylius\\Bundle\\ApiBundle\\ApiPlatform\\Routing\\ApiLoader;"," use Sylius\\Bundle\\ApiBundle\\ApiPlatform\\Routing\\IriConverter;","@@ -59,6 +60,16 @@","         ->private()","     ;"," ","+    $services","+        ->set('sylius_api.api_platform.metadata.resource.metadata_collection_factory.force_eager_aware', ForceEagerAwareResourceMetadataCollectionFactory::class)","+        ->decorate('api_platform.metadata.resource.metadata_collection_factory')","+        ->args([","+            service('.inner'),","+            '%sylius_api.eager_loading.force_eager%',","+        ])","+        ->private()","+    ;","+","     $services","         ->set('sylius_api.api_platform.metadata.resource.metadata_collection_factory.image_filter_aware', ImageFilterAwareResourceMetadataCollectionFactory::class)","         ->decorate('api_platform.metadata.resource.metadata_collection_factory')"],"additions":11,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/Sylius/Bundle/ApiBundle/tests/ApiPlatform/Metadata/Resource/Factory/ForceEagerAwareResourceMetadataCollectionFactoryTest.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,97 @@","+<?php","+","+/*","+ * This file is part of the Sylius package.","+ *","+ * (c) Sylius Sp. z o.o.","+ *","+ * For the full copyright and license information, please view the LICENSE","+ * file that was distributed with this source code.","+ */","+","+declare(strict_types=1);","+","+namespace Tests\\Sylius\\Bundle\\ApiBundle\\ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\Resource\\Factory;","+","+use ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\ApiResource;","+use ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\Get;","+use ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\GetCollection;","+use ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\Operation;","+use ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\Operations;","+use ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\Put;","+use ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\Resource\\Factory\\ResourceMetadataCollectionFactoryInterface;","+use ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\Resource\\ResourceMetadataCollection;","+use PHPUnit\\Framework\\Attributes\\CoversClass;","+use PHPUnit\\Framework\\Attributes\\Test;","+use PHPUnit\\Framework\\Attributes\\TestWith;","+use PHPUnit\\Framework\\TestCase;","+use Sylius\\Bundle\\ApiBundle\\ApiPlatform\\Metadata\\Resource\\Factory\\ForceEagerAwareResourceMetadataCollectionFactory;","+","+#[CoversClass(ForceEagerAwareResourceMetadataCollectionFactory::class)]","+final class ForceEagerAwareResourceMetadataCollectionFactoryTest extends TestCase","+{","+    #[Test]","+    #[TestWith([false])]","+    #[TestWith([true])]","+    public function it_sets_configured_force_eager_on_sylius_read_operations_without_explicit_value(bool $forceEager): void","+    {","+        $operations = $this->getOperations($this->createFactory($forceEager));","+","+        $this->assertSame($forceEager, $operations['sylius_api_admin_product_get_collection']->getForceEager());","+        $this->assertSame($forceEager, $operations['sylius_api_admin_product_get']->getForceEager());","+    }","+","+    #[Test]","+    public function it_keeps_explicitly_defined_force_eager_on_sylius_operations(): void","+    {","+        $operations = $this->getOperations($this->createFactory(false));","+","+        $this->assertTrue($operations['sylius_api_shop_product_get']->getForceEager());","+    }","+","+    #[Test]","+    public function it_does_not_touch_operations_not_provided_by_sylius(): void","+    {","+        $operations = $this->getOperations($this->createFactory(false));","+","+        $this->assertNull($operations['app_custom_get_collection']->getForceEager());","+    }","+","+    #[Test]","+    public function it_does_not_touch_write_operations(): void","+    {","+        $operations = $this->getOperations($this->createFactory(false));","+","+        $this->assertNull($operations['sylius_api_admin_product_put']->getForceEager());","+    }","+","+    #[Test]","+    public function it_skips_resources_without_operations(): void","+    {","+        $factory = $this->createFactory(false, new ApiResource());","+","+        $this->assertNull($factory->create(\\stdClass::class)[0]->getOperations());","+    }","+","+    /** @return array<string, Operation> */","+    private function getOperations(ForceEagerAwareResourceMetadataCollectionFactory $factory): array","+    {","+        return iterator_to_array($factory->create(\\stdClass::class)[0]->getOperations());","+    }","+","+    private function createFactory(bool $forceEager, ?ApiResource $resource = null): ForceEagerAwareResourceMetadataCollectionFactory","+    {","+        $resource ??= (new ApiResource())->withOperations(new Operations([","+            'sylius_api_admin_product_get_collection' => new GetCollection(name: 'sylius_api_admin_product_get_collection'),","+            'sylius_api_admin_product_get' => new Get(name: 'sylius_api_admin_product_get'),","+            'sylius_api_shop_product_get' => new Get(forceEager: true, name: 'sylius_api_shop_product_get'),","+            'sylius_api_admin_product_put' => new Put(name: 'sylius_api_admin_product_put'),","+            'app_custom_get_collection' => new GetCollection(name: 'app_custom_get_collection'),","+        ]));","+","+        $decorated = $this->createStub(ResourceMetadataCollectionFactoryInterface::class);","+        $decorated->method('create')->willReturn(new ResourceMetadataCollection(\\stdClass::class, [$resource]));","+","+        return new ForceEagerAwareResourceMetadataCollectionFactory($decorated, $forceEager);","+    }","+}"],"additions":97,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/Sylius/Bundle/ApiBundle/tests/DependencyInjection/SyliusApiExtensionTest.php","lines":["@@ -136,6 +136,30 @@ public function it_loads_default_filter_eager_loading_extension_restricted_opera","         $this->assertContainerBuilderHasParameter('sylius_api.filter_eager_loading_extension.restricted_resources', []);","     }"," ","+    #[Test]","+    public function it_forces_eager_loading_on_sylius_read_operations_by_default(): void","+    {","+        $this->container->setParameter('kernel.bundles_metadata', ['SyliusApiBundle' => ['path' => __DIR__ . '../..']]);","+","+        $this->load();","+","+        $this->assertContainerBuilderHasParameter('sylius_api.eager_loading.force_eager', true);","+    }","+","+    #[Test]","+    public function it_loads_force_eager_configuration_properly(): void","+    {","+        $this->container->setParameter('kernel.bundles_metadata', ['SyliusApiBundle' => ['path' => __DIR__ . '../..']]);","+","+        $this->load([","+            'eager_loading' => [","+                'force_eager' => false,","+            ],","+        ]);","+","+        $this->assertContainerBuilderHasParameter('sylius_api.eager_loading.force_eager', false);","+    }","+","     #[Test]","     public function it_prepends_configuration_with_api_platform_mapping(): void","     {"],"additions":24,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/Sylius/Bundle/CoreBundle/Order/NumberGenerator/SequentialOrderNumberGenerator.php","lines":["@@ -40,7 +40,11 @@ public function generate(OrderInterface $order): string","     {","         $sequence = $this->getSequence();"," ","-        $this->sequenceManager->lock($sequence, LockMode::OPTIMISTIC, $sequence->getVersion());","+        if ($this->sequenceManager->getConnection()->isTransactionActive()) {","+            $this->lockForUpdate($sequence);","+        } else {","+            $this->sequenceManager->lock($sequence, LockMode::OPTIMISTIC, $sequence->getVersion());","+        }"," ","         $number = $this->generateNumber($sequence->getIndex());","         $sequence->incrementIndex();","@@ -48,6 +52,21 @@ public function generate(OrderInterface $order): string","         return $number;","     }"," ","+    /**","+     * Waits for concurrent transactions holding the row, then reloads the committed index.","+     * Skipped when the sequence is new or its index was already incremented in this unit of work:","+     * the in-memory value is then ahead of the database.","+     */","+    private function lockForUpdate(OrderSequenceInterface $sequence): void","+    {","+        $originalData = $this->sequenceManager->getUnitOfWork()->getOriginalEntityData($sequence);","+        if (($originalData['index'] ?? null) !== $sequence->getIndex()) {","+            return;","+        }","+","+        $this->sequenceManager->refresh($sequence, LockMode::PESSIMISTIC_WRITE);","+    }","+","     private function generateNumber(int $index): string","     {","         $number = $this->startNumber + $index;"],"additions":20,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/Sylius/Bundle/CoreBundle/tests/Order/NumberGenerator/SequentialOrderNumberGeneratorTest.php","lines":["@@ -13,13 +13,16 @@"," "," namespace Tests\\Sylius\\Bundle\\CoreBundle\\Order\\NumberGenerator;"," ","+use Doctrine\\DBAL\\Connection;"," use Doctrine\\DBAL\\LockMode;"," use Doctrine\\ORM\\EntityManagerInterface;","+use Doctrine\\ORM\\UnitOfWork;"," use PHPUnit\\Framework\\MockObject\\MockObject;"," use PHPUnit\\Framework\\TestCase;"," use Sylius\\Bundle\\CoreBundle\\Order\\NumberGenerator\\SequentialOrderNumberGenerator;"," use Sylius\\Bundle\\OrderBundle\\NumberGenerator\\OrderNumberGeneratorInterface;"," use Sylius\\Component\\Core\\Model\\OrderInterface;","+use Sylius\\Component\\Core\\Model\\OrderSequence;"," use Sylius\\Component\\Core\\Model\\OrderSequenceInterface;"," use Sylius\\Resource\\Doctrine\\Persistence\\RepositoryInterface;"," use Sylius\\Resource\\Factory\\FactoryInterface;","@@ -32,6 +35,10 @@ final class SequentialOrderNumberGeneratorTest extends TestCase"," ","     private EntityManagerInterface&MockObject $sequenceManager;"," ","+    private Connection&MockObject $connection;","+","+    private MockObject&UnitOfWork $unitOfWork;","+","     private SequentialOrderNumberGenerator $sequentialOrderNumberGenerator;"," ","     protected function setUp(): void","@@ -39,6 +46,10 @@ protected function setUp(): void","         $this->sequenceRepository = $this->createMock(RepositoryInterface::class);","         $this->sequenceFactory = $this->createMock(FactoryInterface::class);","         $this->sequenceManager = $this->createMock(EntityManagerInterface::class);","+        $this->connection = $this->createMock(Connection::class);","+        $this->unitOfWork = $this->createMock(UnitOfWork::class);","+        $this->sequenceManager->method('getConnection')->willReturn($this->connection);","+        $this->sequenceManager->method('getUnitOfWork')->willReturn($this->unitOfWork);","         $this->sequentialOrderNumberGenerator = new SequentialOrderNumberGenerator(","             $this->sequenceRepository,","             $this->sequenceFactory,","@@ -58,6 +69,7 @@ public function testGeneratesAnOrderNumber(): void"," ","         $sequence->expects($this->once())->method('getIndex')->willReturn(6);","         $sequence->expects($this->once())->method('getVersion')->willReturn(7);","+        $this->connection->method('isTransactionActive')->willReturn(false);","         $this->sequenceRepository->expects($this->once())->method('findOneBy')->with([])->willReturn($sequence);","         $this->sequenceManager->expects($this->once())->method('lock')->with($sequence, LockMode::OPTIMISTIC, 7);","         $sequence->expects($this->once())->method('incrementIndex');","@@ -72,6 +84,7 @@ public function testGeneratesAnOrderNumberWhenSequenceIsNull(): void"," ","         $sequence->expects($this->once())->method('getIndex')->willReturn(0);","         $sequence->expects($this->once())->method('getVersion')->willReturn(1);","+        $this->connection->method('isTransactionActive')->willReturn(false);","         $this->sequenceRepository->expects($this->once())->method('findOneBy')->with([])->willReturn(null);","         $this->sequenceFactory->expects($this->once())->method('createNew')->willReturn($sequence);","         $this->sequenceManager->expects($this->once())->method('persist')->with($sequence);","@@ -80,4 +93,59 @@ public function testGeneratesAnOrderNumberWhenSequenceIsNull(): void"," ","         $this->assertSame('000000001', $this->sequentialOrderNumberGenerator->generate($order));","     }","+","+    public function testReloadsTheSequenceWithAWriteLockInsideATransaction(): void","+    {","+        $sequence = new OrderSequence();","+        $order = $this->createMock(OrderInterface::class);","+","+        $this->connection->method('isTransactionActive')->willReturn(true);","+        $this->sequenceRepository->expects($this->once())->method('findOneBy')->with([])->willReturn($sequence);","+        $this->unitOfWork->method('getOriginalEntityData')->with($sequence)->willReturn(['index' => 0]);","+        $this->sequenceManager->expects($this->never())->method('lock');","+        $this->sequenceManager","+            ->expects($this->once())","+            ->method('refresh')","+            ->with($sequence, LockMode::PESSIMISTIC_WRITE)","+            ->willReturnCallback(static function (OrderSequence $sequence): void {","+                // Another transaction committed index 4 while this one was waiting for the lock.","+                for ($i = 0; $i < 4; ++$i) {","+                    $sequence->incrementIndex();","+                }","+            })","+        ;","+","+        $this->assertSame('000000005', $this->sequentialOrderNumberGenerator->generate($order));","+    }","+","+    public function testDoesNotReloadAnIndexAlreadyIncrementedInTheSameTransaction(): void","+    {","+        $sequence = new OrderSequence();","+        $sequence->incrementIndex();","+        $order = $this->createMock(OrderInterface::class);","+","+        $this->connection->method('isTransactionActive')->willReturn(true);","+        $this->sequenceRepository->expects($this->once())->method('findOneBy')->with([])->willReturn($sequence);","+        $this->unitOfWork->method('getOriginalEntityData')->with($sequence)->willReturn(['index' => 0]);","+        $this->sequenceManager->expects($this->never())->method('lock');","+        $this->sequenceManager->expects($this->never())->method('refresh');","+","+        $this->assertSame('000000002', $this->sequentialOrderNumberGenerator->generate($order));","+    }","+","+    public function testDoesNotReloadANewSequenceInsideATransaction(): void","+    {","+        $sequence = new OrderSequence();","+        $order = $this->createMock(OrderInterface::class);","+","+        $this->connection->method('isTransactionActive')->willReturn(true);","+        $this->sequenceRepository->expects($this->once())->method('findOneBy')->with([])->willReturn(null);","+        $this->sequenceFactory->expects($this->once())->method('createNew')->willReturn($sequence);","+        $this->sequenceManager->expects($this->once())->method('persist')->with($sequence);","+        $this->unitOfWork->method('getOriginalEntityData')->with($sequence)->willReturn([]);","+        $this->sequenceManager->expects($this->never())->method('lock');","+        $this->sequenceManager->expects($this->never())->method('refresh');","+","+        $this->assertSame('000000001', $this->sequentialOrderNumberGenerator->generate($order));","+    }"," }"],"additions":68,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/Functional/SequentialOrderNumberGeneratorTest.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,83 @@","+<?php","+","+/*","+ * This file is part of the Sylius package.","+ *","+ * (c) Sylius Sp. z o.o.","+ *","+ * For the full copyright and license information, please view the LICENSE","+ * file that was distributed with this source code.","+ */","+","+declare(strict_types=1);","+","+namespace Sylius\\Tests\\Functional;","+","+use Doctrine\\DBAL\\Connection;","+use Doctrine\\DBAL\\DriverManager;","+use Doctrine\\DBAL\\Exception\\DriverException;","+use Doctrine\\ORM\\EntityManagerInterface;","+use PHPUnit\\Framework\\Attributes\\Test;","+use Sylius\\Bundle\\OrderBundle\\NumberGenerator\\OrderNumberGeneratorInterface;","+use Sylius\\Component\\Core\\Model\\Order;","+use Symfony\\Bundle\\FrameworkBundle\\Test\\KernelTestCase;","+","+final class SequentialOrderNumberGeneratorTest extends KernelTestCase","+{","+    private EntityManagerInterface $entityManager;","+","+    private OrderNumberGeneratorInterface $numberGenerator;","+","+    /** Plays the role of a concurrent checkout. */","+    private Connection $concurrentConnection;","+","+    protected function setUp(): void","+    {","+        $this->entityManager = self::getContainer()->get('doctrine.orm.entity_manager');","+        $this->numberGenerator = self::getContainer()->get('sylius.number_generator.sequential_order');","+","+        $connection = $this->entityManager->getConnection();","+        $connection->executeStatement('DELETE FROM sylius_order_sequence');","+        $connection->executeStatement('INSERT INTO sylius_order_sequence (id, idx, version) VALUES (1, 0, 1)');","+","+        $this->concurrentConnection = DriverManager::getConnection($connection->getParams());","+    }","+","+    protected function tearDown(): void","+    {","+        $this->concurrentConnection->close();","+","+        parent::tearDown();","+    }","+","+    #[Test]","+    public function it_uses_the_index_committed_by_a_concurrent_checkout_after_the_sequence_was_loaded(): void","+    {","+        $this->entityManager->beginTransaction();","+","+        try {","+            self::getContainer()->get('sylius.repository.order_sequence')->findOneBy([]);","+            $this->concurrentConnection->executeStatement('UPDATE sylius_order_sequence SET idx = idx + 1');","+","+            $this->assertSame('000000002', $this->numberGenerator->generate(new Order()));","+        } finally {","+            $this->entityManager->rollback();","+        }","+    }","+","+    #[Test]","+    public function it_keeps_the_sequence_locked_until_the_transaction_ends(): void","+    {","+        $this->entityManager->beginTransaction();","+","+        try {","+            $this->numberGenerator->generate(new Order());","+","+            $this->expectException(DriverException::class);","+","+            $this->concurrentConnection->executeQuery('SELECT idx FROM sylius_order_sequence FOR UPDATE NOWAIT');","+        } finally {","+            $this->entityManager->rollback();","+        }","+    }","+}",""],"additions":83,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":410,"deletions":2,"truncated":false,"file_count":11},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-17T18:46:02.570896+00:00"}